      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000wp",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Every family's week looks different. Some parents need care five or more days, some two or three, and some only on certain shifts. We offer "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k000wq",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "full-time and part-time"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k000wr",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " child care, and you choose the days and hours you need between 6 am and 11 pm."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000ws",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000wt",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How scheduling works"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000wu",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000wv",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Tell us your work schedule when you call or tour. We'll set up a regular schedule so your child has a steady routine. If your hours change, talk to us and we'll do our best to adjust, as space allows."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000ww",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000wx",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What every schedule includes"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000wy",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000wz",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Full-time or part-time, your child gets the same day: meals and snacks at set times through the USDA food program (CACFP), our play-based Experience Early Learning curriculum for toddlers and young children, and homework help for school-age kids on every shift. Your child is with the same small team every time, led by Ms. Paulette and our director, Tameca Burke. You check in and out with Procare, so every drop-off and pickup is on record."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
